# Accepted findings. Each needs a reason; review when the base image is bumped.
#
# setuptools 70.3.0 (path traversal in PackageIndex.download). Trivy reports it
# with no file path in both service images; removing setuptools and its vendored
# tree in the Dockerfile does not clear it, so its origin is unresolved. The
# flaw is in package-index downloads, which only run at install time, never in
# the running service. Revisit with the next python:3.11-slim bump.
CVE-2025-47273
